    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39867" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικρᾰτ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>master</i> of a thing:
			only 
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ μάχῃ</span>
			<i>superior</i> in . . , <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.88
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερός τινος γενόμενος</span>
			having <i>the</i>
			<i>upper hand of . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				55.30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -έστερον φέρειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Memn.
					34.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -έστερον</span> with <i>success</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				37.2
			</span></i>.—<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τέως</span>
			<i>with</i>
			<i>overwhelming might, impetuously</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.67
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				81
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				23.863
			</span></i> (never in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>); so <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				321
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.367
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
